<title>FINLAND: Valmet wins FIM 70 mln machine rebuild.</title>
<headline>Valmet wins FIM 70 mln machine rebuild.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had won an order worth more than 70 million markka to rebuild a paperboard machine at Korsnas AB's mill in Gavle, Sweden.</p>
<p>After the rebuild, the machine's output capacity would be about 320,000 tonnes per year, Valmet said. It gave no comparison but said the rebuild would help improve the quality of the liquid packaging board produced by the machine.</p>
<p>The machine also made linerboard, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
